{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is detected, move and take it, check its color and do a task with it, otherwise scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectAccessible    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
